if we wanted to do season 2,

544
00:19:02,160 --> 00:19:04,000
I answered immediately.

545
00:19:04,130 --> 00:19:06,010
I said let's do it as soon as possible!

546
00:19:06,010 --> 00:19:09,360
Even though at that time, it hadn't been
decided that I would be the director.

547
00:19:09,360 --> 00:19:10,000
But I said back then,

548
00:19:10,000 --> 00:19:11,400
I hoped this series could be renewed.

549
00:19:11,400 --> 00:19:12,530
I felt

550
00:19:12,930 --> 00:19:14,930
there should still be, for example,

551
00:19:15,060 --> 00:19:16,360
many stories worth telling.

552
00:19:16,360 --> 00:19:19,220
That is, the stories
of these four main characters.

553
00:19:21,360 --> 00:19:23,360
Although GELBOYS Season 2

554
00:19:23,360 --> 00:19:24,960
will have a brand new storyline,

555
00:19:24,960 --> 00:19:26,760
and maybe in some
audio-visual styles and tones,

556
00:19:26,760 --> 00:19:30,730
it will be different from
the first season or something like that.

557
00:19:30,730 --> 00:19:31,330
But,

558
00:19:32,160 --> 00:19:34,060
what I think we absolutely cannot discard,

559
00:19:34,060 --> 00:19:36,960
is the unique core specific to GELBOYS.

560
00:19:45,500 --> 00:19:48,200
[GELBOY 01-04]

561
00:19:52,560 --> 00:19:54,140
The four of us in GELBOYS

562
00:19:54,140 --> 00:19:56,000
are like we've been through
a world war together.

563
00:19:56,000 --> 00:19:56,730
You know what I mean?

564
00:19:56,730 --> 00:19:58,730
We are literally like the Avengers.

565
00:19:59,100 --> 00:20:01,160
The advantage of the four of us is that

566
00:20:01,260 --> 00:20:03,560
we are definitely
not the kind of people who,

567
00:20:03,560 --> 00:20:04,200
when things happen, blame each other.

568
00:20:04,200 --> 00:20:06,330
We choose to move forward hand in hand.

569
00:20:06,860 --> 00:20:08,960
And it's always been like this.

570
00:20:08,960 --> 00:20:11,460
Whether it's strengths, weaknesses,
highlights, or shortcomings,

571
00:20:11,460 --> 00:20:12,720
when we shoot every scene,

572
00:20:12,720 --> 00:20:14,960
we always help each other find
the best acting state.

573
00:20:14,960 --> 00:20:16,660
For instance, this time,

574
00:20:16,930 --> 00:20:19,160
acting with New gives me a feeling of,

575
00:20:19,160 --> 00:20:21,600
hey, I really enjoy it.

576
00:20:22,730 --> 00:20:24,000
Because we spend time
together every day now,

577
00:20:24,000 --> 00:20:25,500
I can tell what Pide is thinking
at a glance.

578
00:20:25,500 --> 00:20:26,200
And then,

579
00:20:27,100 --> 00:20:28,050
compared to the first season,

580
00:20:28,050 --> 00:20:31,130
because we have become more
synchronized and in tune with each other,

581
00:20:31,130 --> 00:20:32,900
when they count down "5, 4, 3, 2" on set,
we can nail it in one take.

582
00:20:32,900 --> 00:20:35,030
And it's always been this way.

583
00:20:35,030 --> 00:20:38,260
I also always say
that Pide is actually like

584
00:20:38,600 --> 00:20:40,870
my great partner.

585
00:20:40,870 --> 00:20:43,160
I'm really, really happy to be able to

586
00:20:44,360 --> 00:20:46,560
be by his side and act together with him.

587
00:20:47,860 --> 00:20:50,990
Believe it or not,
I actually thought about this before.

588
00:20:51,730 --> 00:20:53,060
That is to say, to answer directly,

589
00:20:53,060 --> 00:20:54,660
I feel that GELBOYS is everything.

590
00:20:54,660 --> 00:20:57,190
It's everything in my life,
things like that.

591
00:20:57,330 --> 00:20:58,130
Well,

592
00:20:58,660 --> 00:21:02,590
I started participating in GELBOYS Season1
around my sophomore year.

593
00:21:03,100 --> 00:21:06,130
And I've kept at it
until I've already graduated now.

594
00:21:07,730 --> 00:21:09,530
I also learned a lot from Leon.

595
00:21:09,960 --> 00:21:12,400
Like observing many things from him.

596
00:21:12,960 --> 00:21:17,760
Whether in terms of acting
or in our daily lives,

597
00:21:17,760 --> 00:21:20,730
because we spend time together every day,

598
00:21:21,130 --> 00:21:22,940
working and seeing
each other almost daily,

599
00:21:22,940 --> 00:21:24,200
I get to see things like

600
00:21:24,530 --> 00:21:25,470
his lifestyle.

601
00:21:25,470 --> 00:21:28,830
So I unconsciously adjust myself
following Leon.

602
00:21:28,830 --> 00:21:32,100
For instance, I try to
work out and focus on health.

603
00:21:32,100 --> 00:21:36,060
I occasionally eat healthy light meals.

604
00:21:36,060 --> 00:21:37,160
Although not very frequently,

605
00:21:37,160 --> 00:21:41,500
I also choose to try hard to follow
those good living habits.

606
00:21:42,160 --> 00:21:44,420
Or even our dressing styles are the same.

607
00:21:45,460 --> 00:21:46,880
We influence each other.

608
00:21:47,050 --> 00:21:48,680
I will also recommend some things to him.

609
00:21:48,680 --> 00:21:51,020
Sometimes I will ask him,
"Where did you buy this?" and such.

610
00:21:51,020 --> 00:21:53,150
We have completely blended together.

611
00:21:53,230 --> 00:21:55,440
I feel like I met a very good partner,

612
00:21:55,440 --> 00:21:59,560
even more than before, we can understand
each other's thoughts with just a look.

613
00:21:59,560 --> 00:22:03,160
If someone could time travel from the
future two years later back to that day

614
00:22:03,160 --> 00:22:04,170
and tell me,

615
00:22:04,170 --> 00:22:05,350
"Leon, you will achieve
these things in the future,

616
00:22:05,350 --> 00:22:07,650
perform in concerts, attend those events,

617
00:22:07,650 --> 00:22:10,100
and become an
ambassador for many brands, etc."

618
00:22:10,100 --> 00:22:11,400
I definitely wouldn't believe it.

619
00:22:11,400 --> 00:22:13,160
Because this is just a TV series.

620
00:22:13,160 --> 00:22:14,120
But up to today,

621
00:22:14,150 --> 00:22:17,720
all of this is no longer just a series.

622
00:22:18,600 --> 00:22:20,500
Personally, this is family.

623
00:22:21,360 --> 00:22:24,300
I think it's actually not hard
to get familiar with someone.

624
00:22:24,300 --> 00:22:26,730
But after getting familiar,
and truly understand each other deeply,

625
00:22:26,730 --> 00:22:28,700
it's something that only comes by chance.

626
00:22:28,700 --> 00:22:32,360
And I feel that PJ and I
have already achieved this understanding.

627
00:22:32,360 --> 00:22:35,030
We've been together for over a year.

628
00:22:35,410 --> 00:22:36,570
Starting from workshops,
from costume fitting,

629
00:22:36,570 --> 00:22:39,360
we didn't know each other then,
didn't know this guy,

630
00:22:39,360 --> 00:22:40,620
didn't know who he was.

631
00:22:41,060 --> 00:22:44,400
Now we almost
know everything about each other.

632
00:22:45,370 --> 00:22:49,730
Our relationship
is no longer just working partners,

633
00:22:50,530 --> 00:22:52,420
but two people
who truly understand each other.

634
00:22:52,420 --> 00:22:55,000
So even today, I still feel very grateful.

635
00:22:55,000 --> 00:22:57,660
I also feel really lucky
to have PJ as my partner.

636
00:23:00,250 --> 00:23:01,010
Well,

637
00:23:02,330 --> 00:23:04,400
this is the end of the special episode.

638
00:23:04,400 --> 00:23:06,060
If you want to watch episode 1,

639
00:23:06,100 --> 00:23:07,560
please look forward to it.

640
00:23:09,060 --> 00:23:09,860
Bye-bye.

641
00:23:11,200 --> 00:23:12,330
Thank you very much.

642
00:23:13,360 --> 00:23:14,160
GELBOYS.

643
00:23:19,060 --> 00:23:19,860
Bye-bye.

644
00:23:21,870 --> 00:23:23,950
Also, thank you so much to all the

645
00:23:23,950 --> 00:23:26,370
Water Lily fans who came
to watch the special episode.

646
00:23:26,370 --> 00:23:28,360
Hope we can meet in the official episodes.

647
00:23:28,360 --> 00:23:29,860
Or if we've already met in the series,

648
00:23:29,860 --> 00:23:31,130
we might bump into each other off-screen.

649
00:23:31,130 --> 00:23:33,560
Maybe we'll have a chance
to stroll around Siam Square.

650
00:23:33,560 --> 00:23:35,920
Don't forget to get your nails done,
don't forget to eat your favorite food.

651
00:23:35,920 --> 00:23:38,250
And don't forget
to live the life you want.

652
00:23:39,100 --> 00:23:40,130
Bye-bye.

653
00:23:43,400 --> 00:23:46,130
I really love this season.
You guys must watch it.

654
00:23:51,850 --> 00:23:55,650
[GELBOYS Season 2]

655
